00:00:23.481 --> 00:00:24.774
- (Cody):  My mom's a strong woman.

00:00:26.317 --> 00:00:27.861
I can't imagine being

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:28.862
in that situation

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:29.863
like she was

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:30.864
and having to overcome

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:33.283
all those obstacles that she did.

