00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:41.416
That's why she's like a hero to us.

00:00:42.751 --> 00:00:44.627
We have so much love for our mom.

00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:46.838
We do truly understand

00:00:46.838 --> 00:00:48.923
that we definitely wouldn't be here without her.

00:00:50.072 --> 00:00:51.798
That's why everything we do now is, you know, 

